{"suttaId":"tha-ap195","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7261,7276],"vripara":"12"},"segments":{"tha-ap195:0.3":"Khaṇḍapulliyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap195:1.1":"“Phussassa kho bhagavato, thūpo āsi mahāvane;","tha-ap195:1.3":"Kuñjarehi tadā bhinno, parūḷho pādapo [parūḷhapādapo (sī.), saṃrūḷho pādapo (syā.)] tahiṃ.","tha-ap195:2.1":"“Visamañca samaṃ katvā, sudhāpiṇḍaṃ adāsahaṃ;","tha-ap195:2.3":"Tilokagaruno tassa, guṇehi paritosito [parito suto (ka.)].","tha-ap195:3.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap195:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, sudhāpiṇḍassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap195:4.1":"“Sattasattatikappamhi, jitasenāsuṃ soḷasa;","tha-ap195:4.3":"Sattaratanasampannā, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap195:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap195:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā khaṇḍaphulliyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap195:7.1":"Khaṇḍapulliyattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
